  - MissingAbsolutePath: allow shell builtins (cd, echo, read, exit,
    return, pwd, set, unset, alias, export, ...) and add common package
    managers / build tools / monitors to the allowlist
  - New rule: IFSManipulation (high) — IFS= overrides and $IFS-bound
    expansions
  - New rule: DangerousExpansion (high) — ${!var}, ${var@P},
    ${var=value}, nested $(...) in ${...} (CVE-2026-29783 class)
  - New rule: ReverseShellSink (high) — nc -e, ncat -e, socat exec:,
    bash -i with /dev/tcp, ssh ProxyCommand, mkfifo
  - New rule: DangerousFilesystem (high/medium) — dd of=/dev/sdX,
    mkfs*, fdisk, parted, : > /etc/..., truncate -s 0 system paths,
    shred, mount / loop / crypto
  - SensitiveAccess: extend with 13 additional credential paths
    (.docker/config.json, .gnupg/private-keys, .git-credentials,
